  <ifrs:DescriptionOfMaterialLeasingArrangementsByLessorClassifiedAsFinanceLease contextRef="Q01D">No aplica</ifrs:DescriptionOfMaterialLeasingArrangementsByLessorClassifiedAsFinanceLease>
